{"reviewId": "415037660_84kJ7CF1T", "review": {"abstract": "康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "或许本质是代际之间的财富转移。大多数年老人是不会愿意在死之前将大量资本主导权转移给下一代，年轻人想要变富，只能是政府政策主导下的新游戏，间接转移财富。1、老一辈不舍得放手的农业土地耕种主导权，年轻人不再耕种，转向政府主导的土地开发与城市工业如土木建造房地产等。年轻人逐渐年老，新一代年轻人转向政府主导的新科技智能ai+新能源行业+出海战略。年轻人的游戏必须有两个特征：1、大部分普通年老人无法参与。2、成为撬动年老人财富的工具以实现代际财富转移。我这一段自我感觉都写得挺仇老，但某种程度应该算客观现实。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "953-986", "createTime": 1761984647, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "415037660_84kJ7CF1T", "userVid": 415037660, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 415037660, "name": "云梦散人", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/8h9QXaJ70ibdzuZUnCjBib3eO4EMYn7rGT17RoQI6V2uZryCp3TuzPGLeiclTAYOialEXdicDgP9GZN0/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "云梦散人", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241118-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 223726918, "name": "柳贯一", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-Whw4kl8nMGVeDAFoA~OOvfc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "柳贯一", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250310-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", 